e link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Freida_Oberon\" title=\"Freida Oberon\">Freida Oberon</a> – A prominent member of the family residing in the city</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lady_Oberon%27s_Bodyguard\" title=\"Lady Oberon's Bodyguard\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Portrait_Lady_Oberon%27s_Bodyguard.png/30px-Portrait_Lady_Oberon%27s_Bodyguard.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/83/Portrait_Lady_Oberon%27s_Bodyguard.png/45px-Portrait_Lady_Oberon%27s_Bodyguard.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/83/Portrait_Lady_Oberon%27s_Bodyguard.png/60px-Portrait_Lady_Oberon%27s_Bodyguard.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lady Oberon's Bodyguard\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Portrait_Lady_Oberon%27s_Bodyguard.png/30px-Portrait_Lady_Oberon%27s_Bodyguard.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/83/Portrait_Lady_Oberon%27s_Bodyguard.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lady_Oberon%27s_Bodyguard\" title=\"Lady Oberon's Bodyguard\">Lady Oberon's Bodyguard</a> – The personal security for Lady Freida Oberon</li>\n<li>Lady Harette Oberon – Referenced in the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Art_Show_Schedule\" title=\"Art Show Schedule\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png/40px-Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" 